Termux - terminal-emulator and terminal-view
https://github.com/termux/termux-app at 3df69d1da197dd9bd71a3bafd902dffd720576b4
Licence: Apache License 2.0 (the text is in LICENSE)

Only the terminal-emulator and terminal-view modules, which termux-app's LICENSE.md carves out of
its GPLv3 repository as Apache-2.0 code inherited from Terminal Emulator for Android
(https://github.com/jackpal/Android-Terminal-Emulator, Jack Palevich). Nothing from the rest of
the repository is used.

Transcribed: the escape-sequence parser and the screen, cursor, row, tab-stop, margin and mode
logic of the terminal emulator, in app/src/main/java/com/jupydroid/app/terminal/ and their tests
in app/src/test/java/com/jupydroid/app/terminal/. Each file names the upstream class it follows.

